<item><title>DP World plans to raise Mozambique cargo capacity to 650 mil TEU</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/dp-world-plans-to-raise-mozambique-cargo-capacity-to-650-149cc9/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/dp-world-plans-to-raise-mozambique-cargo-capacity-to-650-149cc9/</guid><category>Mozambique</category><description>The company told President Daniel Chapo it wants to lift handling capacity from 225 mil to approximately 650 mil TEU by the second quarter of 2027.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:44:50 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/dp-world-plans-to-raise-mozambique-cargo-capacity-to-650-149cc9/share.jpg" length="43828" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/dp-world-plans-to-raise-mozambique-cargo-capacity-to-650-149cc9/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Guro opens 25 de Junho primary school and a supermarket</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/guro-opens-25-de-junho-primary-school-and-a-supermarket-2ae9f9/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/guro-opens-25-de-junho-primary-school-and-a-supermarket-2ae9f9/</guid><category>Mozambique</category><description>Mayor Latifo Vinho opened both facilities, with the school costing 5.8 million meticais to put up.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 05:51:12 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" length="36290" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
