<item><title>Mozambique judge halts Mondlane trial over late 223-page defence filing</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-judge-halts-mondlane-trial-over-late-223-page-b95f2e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-judge-halts-mondlane-trial-over-late-223-page-b95f2e/</guid><category>Mozambique</category><description>The Supreme Court hearing was paused about an hour early after the defence asked to distribute copies of its written response to other parties.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 15:33:15 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" length="36290" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
